# Rust workspace rules

- Keep crate boundaries: `lambda_app` → `lambda_core` → `lambda_modbus` + `lambda_catalog`; mock only via test/feature.
- No cycles between crates. Modbus I/O and timers must not block the GPUI UI thread.
- Serialize all Modbus requests through one client queue.
- Pin GPUI; commit `Cargo.lock`. Prefer Edition 2021 (or repo standard).
- After meaningful Rust edits: `cargo fmt` and `cargo check -p <crate>` (or `scripts/check.sh` when workspace exists).
- Encode/decode and validation live with catalog/core — not ad-hoc in views.
